Well, as I said, the design of the game is great but......... the developer is very inefficient. Bugs and bugs everywhere, days to patch the bug they have just created, unstable matchmaking (trying 2vs2 with a friend means you sometimes will play with him, sometimes both of you will join a different match, sometimes you will join the same match but in opposite sides and most of the time one of you will join a match and the other one will get an error). So, I think I will keep playing for a while because I have a lot of cards and decks, but I will not recommend this to anyone who is not playing it right now.

